Implementations Directory Overview

Reference_Implementation/OPSsig-128
  ISO C reference implementation for the 128-bit OPS signature parameter set.
  Includes the ICCS SIG API adapter, build script, correctness test, speed
  benchmark, memory benchmark, optional NTT/vector regression tests, KAT
  generator and self-evaluation export targets.

Reference_Implementation/OPSsig-256
  ISO C reference implementation for the 256-bit OPS signature parameter set.
  Includes the ICCS SIG API adapter, build script, correctness test, speed
  benchmark, memory benchmark, KAT generator and self-evaluation export
  targets.

Reference_Implementation/OPSsig-512
  ISO C reference implementation for the 512-bit OPS signature parameter set.
  Includes the ICCS SIG API adapter, build script, correctness test, speed
  benchmark, memory benchmark, optional NTT/vector regression tests, KAT
  generator and self-evaluation export targets.

Optimized_Implementation/OPSsig-128-avx2
  AVX2-optimized implementation for the 128-bit OPS signature parameter set.
  Includes the ICCS SIG API adapter, build script, correctness test, speed
  benchmark, memory benchmark, NTT/vector regression tests, KAT generator and
  self-evaluation export targets.

Optimized_Implementation/OPSsig-256-avx2
  AVX2-optimized implementation for the 256-bit OPS signature parameter set.
  Includes the ICCS SIG API adapter, build script, correctness test, speed
  benchmark, memory benchmark, NTT/vector regression tests, KAT generator and
  self-evaluation export targets.

Optimized_Implementation/OPSsig-512-avx2
  AVX2-optimized implementation for the 512-bit OPS signature parameter set.
  Includes the ICCS SIG API adapter, build script, correctness test, speed
  benchmark, memory benchmark, NTT/vector regression tests, KAT generator and
  self-evaluation export targets.

Self_Evaluation
  Shared self-evaluation framework containing environment collection, memory
  export, report/dependency templates.

